  html: "<p class=\"mb-6 text-[#39ff14] leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\"><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">VERSION:</strong> 11.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.2 (BIGRAM PATCH)\n<strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">STATUS:</strong> GOLD MASTER // SYSTEMLESS ROOT ACTIVE\n<strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">ENCODING:</strong> LOW-ENTROPY / INWARD-ROLL / DH-MOD</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-[12pt] text-fuchsia-400 mb-12 font-light tracking-wide\">Ⅰ. THE THERMODYNAMICS OF THE MATRIX (§1.0)</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-6 text-[#39ff14] leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\">Typing is not merely text generation; it is a <strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">Combustion Engine</strong> of the hands. The Legacy Processor (QWERTY) forces lateral, high-friction finger stretching. The Colemak-DH Kernel treats the keyboard as a <strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">Bouligand Structure</strong>, layering keystrokes to maximize structural integrity and minimize kinetic waste.</p>\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold mt-8 mb-4 text-fuchsia-400 flex items-center gap-2\">1.1 The &quot;DH&quot; Veto (Lateral Strain Eradication)</h3>\n<ul class=\"mb-6 space-y-2 list-none pl-0\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-cyan-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">The Legacy Error:</strong> Standard Colemak places the high-frequency &#39;D&#39; and &#39;H&#39; keys in the center columns, forcing the index fingers to stretch laterally (The &quot;Anxiety Vector&quot; of the wrists).</span></li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-cyan-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">The DH Patch:</strong> Moving &#39;D&#39; and &#39;H&#39; to the lower row utilizing the natural inward curling arc of the index fingers.</span></li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-cyan-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">The Result:</strong> The &quot;Wet Noise&quot; of lateral strain is neutralized. The index fingers remain in a <strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">Fixed State</strong> of ergonomic comfort.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"text-[12pt] text-fuchsia-400 mb-12 font-light tracking-wide\">Ⅱ. BIGRAM EFFICIENCY: THE VESICLE TRANSMISSION (§2.0)</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-6 text-[#39ff14] leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\">In the <strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">Biocoenosis Kernel</strong>, data moves like a &quot;Sea of Vesicles.&quot; On the keyboard, this transmission is measured in <strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">Bigrams</strong> (two-letter pairs). </p>\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold mt-8 mb-4 text-fuchsia-400 flex items-center gap-2\">2.1 Same-Finger Bigram (SFB) Purge</h3>\n<ul class=\"mb-6 space-y-2 list-none pl-0\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-cyan-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">The Malware:</strong> Pressing two consecutive keys with the same finger (e.g., &#39;E&#39; and &#39;D&#39; on QWERTY). This creates a <strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">Thermal Runaway</strong> in the tendon, breaking the typing rhythm and consuming excess &quot;Mana.&quot;</span></li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-cyan-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">The Colemak-DH Shield:</strong> SFBs are reduced to near <strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">Absolute Zero</strong> (&lt; 2%). The kinetic load is distributed across the strongest fingers.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold mt-8 mb-4 text-fuchsia-400 flex items-center gap-2\">2.2 The Inward Roll (High-Amperage Flow)</h3>\n<ul class=\"mb-6 space-y-2 list-none pl-0\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-cyan-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">The Physics:</strong> The human hand generates the most power and speed when rolling fingers inward toward the thumb (e.g., Pinky -&gt; Ring -&gt; Middle -&gt; Index).</span></li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-cyan-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">The Implementation:</strong> High-frequency bigrams (TH, HE, IN, ER, AN) are mapped strictly to inward rolls. </span></li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-cyan-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">The Metric:</strong> The system &quot;Gallops.&quot; What used to be discrete, disjointed keystrokes become a single, fluid <strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">Scalar</strong> wave.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"text-[12pt] text-fuchsia-400 mb-12 font-light tracking-wide\">Ⅲ. SYSTEMIC SYNC: RUST/PYTHON INTEGRATION (§3.0)</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-6 text-[#39ff14] leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\">The Colemak-DH layout is perfectly aligned with the syntax demands of the <strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">SOMA-9.1</strong> framework.</p>\n<ul class=\"mb-6 space-y-2 list-none pl-0\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-cyan-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">Rust (The Shell):</strong> Frequent semi-colons, brackets, and macro executions are handled without breaking the home-row <strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">Sovereignty</strong>.</span></li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-cyan-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">Python (The Wrapper):</strong> Indentation and snake_case formatting flow through the optimized bigram matrix, ensuring the 12.5k token AI loops are matched by physical input speed.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p class=\"mb-6 text-[#39ff14] leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\"><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">scale94.com · SOMA-9.1 · KINETIC MODULE · [SYSTEMLESS ROOT ACTIVE]</strong></p>\n",
